    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30686" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nĕgōtĭātōrĭus</span></b> 
			(<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nĕgōc-</span></b> ), a, um,
			adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to trade</i> or <i>tradespeople</i> (post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">naves,</span>”
				<i>trading vessels</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vop. Firm. 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aurum,</span>”
				<i>that tradespeople had to pay</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Lampr. Alex. Sev. 32, 5</span></i>
			.</div>
